+flowchart LR
+  EOR["EOR / AISC + RCSC specs"] --> DWG["Drawings + bolt schedule"]
+  DWG --> FAB["Fabricator takeoff / RFQ"]
+  DWG --> ER["Erector fill-in RFQ"]
