+### Honest M365 assessment
+
+The driver implements typed **and** executable read paths for mail, calendar, SharePoint, and OneDrive. It does not merely define schemas. The missing layer is ingestion orchestration: checkpointed delta polling, attachment retrieval, normalization into shared file-processing contracts, storage, and provenance binding. Teams content and all write operations are **NOT FOUND**.
