+# LeJeune Bolt site raw-corpus index
+
+- Access date: `2026-08-25`
+- Scope: `lejeunebolt.com`, the directly linked `rentals.lejeunebolt.com` store,
+  and the directly linked first-party TNA microsite at `tightenright.com`.
+- Enumeration: `robots.txt`, the eight sitemaps listed by `sitemap.xml`, recursive
+  same-site link discovery, and eight first-party search-result pages used to test
+  named gaps.
+- Fetch result: 550 source URL requests; 538 returned HTTP 200 and 12 returned
+  HTTP 404. The corpus includes 373 HTML responses, 146 retrievable PDFs, 18 XML responses,
+  ten CAD files, one DOCX, one XLSX, and one plain-text response.
+- Stored artifacts: 390 top-level Markdown page/search dumps, 148 PDF Markdown
+  records in the [`PDF ledger`](pdf/INDEX.md), and 12 non-PDF attachment records
+  in the [`attachment ledger`](attachments/INDEX.md). Every record carries its
+  source URL, final URL, status, content type, and access date.
+- Storage convention: linked PDFs and non-HTML attachments were downloaded to a
+  temporary working area for inspection. The retained Markdown records contain
+  metadata, hashes where applicable, and extractable text while staying under the
+  requested 200 KB per-file limit.
